'''''Cyclophora intermixtaria''''' is a [[moth]] of the family [[Geometridae]] [[Species description|first described]] by [[Charles Swinhoe]] in 1892.<ref>{{cite web |last=Yu |first=Dicky Sick Ki |url=http://www.taxapad.com/local.php?taxonidLC=82869678 |title=''Anisodes intermixtaria'' Swinhoe 1892 |website=Home of Ichneumonoidea |publisher=Taxapad |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160326045215/http://www.taxapad.com/local.php?taxonidLC=82869678 |archive-date=March 26, 2016}}</ref> It is found in [[Taiwan]],<ref>{{cite web |last=Lee |first=Han |date=December 2, 2016 |url=http://taibnet.sinica.edu.tw/chi/taibnet_species_detail.php?name_code=344649 |title='' Cyclophora intermixtaria'' (Swinhoe, 1892) 鋸紋褐姬尺蛾 |website=Catalogue of Life in Taiwan |language=zh |publisher=Biodiversity Research Center, [[Academia Sinica]] |accessdate=April 8, 2020}}</ref> the [[Himalayas]], [[Peninsular Malaysia]] and [[Borneo]].<ref>{{cite web |last=Holloway |first=Jeremy Daniel |title=''Cyclophora intermixtaria'' Swinhoe comb. n. |url=http://www.mothsofborneo.com/part-10/cosymbiini/cosymbiini_3_12.php |website=The Moths of Borneo |accessdate=April 8, 2020}}</ref>

==Subspecies==
*''Cyclophora intermixtaria intermixtaria''
*''Cyclophora intermixtaria collustrata'' <small>Prout, 1938</small> (Borneo)

